rem Counting Block Combinations II
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=115
rem Find the least row length where the
rem fill count with red blocks of a
rem minimum length first exceeds a
rem target

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Min integer = 50
option Target integer = 1000000
option Size integer = 300

rem Same recurrence as problem 114, run
rem to a generous length.
Ways = array shape (Size + 1) fill 1
for N in Min to Size
  Pre = (Ways take (N - Min)) sum
  Ways N = Ways (N - 1) + 1 + Pre
end
Over = Ways greater Target
Answer = Ways first index where Over
Answer print
